Local changes to the vendored files (design doc 57, follow-up 1):

- every file: a provenance header and `#![allow(missing_docs, clippy::manual_is_multiple_of)]` (the crate
  warns on undocumented public items and denies a lint newer than the code; the text is otherwise untouched)
- config.rs: `laya_core::error::{Error, Result}` replaced by a local
  `Error::Config(String)` + `Result` alias (laya-core is not a dependency);
  `AgentConfig::temperature_for` (used laya-core's `temp_bucket`; ours is
  `laya::LayaConfig::temperature`) and the `raw: Value` field (kept upstream
  for their `convert` command) removed
- model.rs: `use crate::config` → `use super::config`; the Metal mask
  regression test is gated on `cfg(target_os = "macos")` instead of the
  crate feature `metal`, which does not exist here (Metal is a target dependency)
